OL,3,GNEWSALondon Underground lines already
OL,4,Adisrupted as drivers set to begin
OL,5,Astrike action
OL,6,
OL,7,FA planned 24-hour strike starting at
OL,8,Fmidday by RMT union members is already
OL,9,Fcausing disruption on parts of the
OL,10,FLondon Underground network
OL,12,FThere is no service on the Circle line,
OL,13,Fwhile other lines also have delays
OL,14,Fahead of the action beginning at midday
OL,16,FThis walkout will last for 24 hours,
OL,17,Fafter last-ditch talks between the
OL,18,Funion and Transport for London (TfL)
OL,19,Ffailed on Tuesday
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
