OL,5,Astrike action
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe disagreement centres around the
OL,8,Fproposed voluntary introduction of a
OL,9,Ffour-day working week with condensed
OL,10,Fhours - and there are further strikes
OL,11,Fplanned in December, January and
OL,12,FFebruary
